text = "Dear Matthew,

I wanted to let you know that the Great Wizard and I have gone on an adventure. Don’t worry, we will be back as soon as our journey is finished.

While I’m away, please make yourself at home at my place. Sleep well, help yourself to anything you need, and stay safe. Most importantly, keep up with your studies at the Academy every day and keep practicing your magic.

Take care of yourself, and I’ll see you soon with plenty of stories to tell.

Your friend,
Arith"

